# Cursor IDE Enterprise Architecture Rules

- Ground all architectural proposals against the five configured MCP servers:
  1. sap-help-portal-local (APIM XML policies and fault handling)
  2. sap-api-hub-local (OData v2/v4 models and CloudEvents)
  3. sap-notes (SAP Support Notes and KBAs on me.sap.com)
  4. sap-docs-community (Community blogs and ABAP matrices)
  5. sap-developers-search (Tutorials and missions)
- Enforce SAP Clean Core compliance (Contract C1 Released APIs).
- Maintain the strict two-stage response format: Executive statement with Mermaid diagram, followed by Developer, Architect, and Governance perspectives.
- Avoid decorative emojis and superficial conversational filler.
